OL,3,GNEWSAThree convicted over death of army
OL,4,Aveteran
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and two women have been convicted
OL,7,Fof manslaughter over the death of an
OL,8,Farmy veteran who suffered fatal head
OL,9,Finjuries after being punched to the
OL,10,Fground during a night out.
OL,12,FMartin Chadburn, 53, who was an
OL,13,Femployee of the Hull 4 Heroes charity,
OL,14,Fwas taken to hospital after the
OL,15,Fincident in the city's Queen Victoria
OL,16,FSquare in the early hours of 19 April.
OL,17,FHe died two days later.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
